  "title": "The new CNIL recommendations: Email tracking pixels in France",
  "summary": "The French Data Protection Authority (CNIL) published its recommendations reiterating and reconfirming the European Data Protection Board’s guidelines and position regarding the use of email tracking pixels and the ePrivacy Directive. By assessing your email marketing programs and compliance and making any needed adjustments, you can help to support the continued success of your customer engagement efforts.",
